      "writtenOn": "2023-11-13T17:23:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Michael, could you please correct me if I\u0027m wrong, but to me it seems that both variants generate the same code: https://godbolt.org/z/cxs9ochGc\n\nFrom my understanding, all types in an arithmetic expression get automatically expanded to the largest type, which is already \"long long\" due to the `1000000LL` constant.",
