      "writtenOn": "2023-11-13T20:45:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK, yeah, I\u0027ve checked x86 MSVC on Godbolt (I can\u0027t find clang or gcc for this arch, perhaps I need to use flags or something), and indeed only the 2nd variant (with long long) actually expands a 32-bit word into 64-bit double word before multiplying. Perhaps, the rule for expansion is trickier than I imagined.\n\nThanks for fixing, Michael!",
